Moving along x-axis
M107                     ; Turn off part cooling fan
G90                      ; Use absolute positioning
M82                      ; Use absolute mode for extruder
M104 S[first_layer_temperature] T0  ; Set extruder temp (non-wait)
M140 S[first_layer_bed_temperature] ; Set bed temp (non-wait)
G28                      ; Home all axes
BED_MESH_PROFILE LOAD=default
G1 X20 Y20 Z5 F3000      ; Trigger mesh
G1 X10 Y10 F2000
M190 S[first_layer_bed_temperature] ; Wait for bed temp
M109 S[first_layer_temperature]     ; Wait for extruder temp
G4 P10000                ; Heat soak for 10 seconds
M117 Purging...
G92 E0
G1 Z0.32 F3000           ; Match your first layer height
G1 X10 Y10 F3000         ; Start position
G1 X200 Y10 E20 F1500    ; First purge line along X-axis
G1 X200 Y12 F5000        ; Quick wipe move
G1 X10 Y12 E25 F1500     ; Second purge line along X-axis
G92 E0
G1 Z0.35 F3000           ; Lift slightly before print
M117 Printing...

